<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Perez Companc started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Perez Companc started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>HSBC James Capel began coverage of Argentine energy company Perez Companc SA Thursday with a rating of hold.</p>
<p>-- In a report, HSBC James Capel said the company was fairly valued and had excellent management and proven expertise in the energy sector.</p>
<p>-- Perez Companc's shares closed Wednesday at 8.08 pesos in Buenos Aires.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
